        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSF3225, Heavy Duty Floor Mount Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 3\" Heavy Duty Floor Mount Door Bumper can be installed on wood, concrete, or tile floors. This bumper is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact BEFORE the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the knob or lever as well. Includes mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSF3225-specifications.gif?v=1704354634\" width=\"600\" height=\"262\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSF3225 3 Inch Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: With a door hold open hook <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-floor-mount-bumper-with-hook-deltana-sahf358\"><b>Deltana SAHF358 Door Stop with Catch</b></a> and <b><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\">Replacement Rubber Tip</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DSF3225 Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Rubber Bumper</b></a>: 15/16\" Diameter, Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSF3225.pdf?v=1704262154\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  DSF3225 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Heavy Duty Floor Mount Door Bumper",
                "description": "Heavy Duty Floor Mount Door Bumper, Deltana DSF3225 - This 3 Inch Heavy Duty Floor Mount Door Bumper can be installed on wood, concrete, or tile floors. This bumper is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact BEFORE the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the knob or lever as well. Includes mounting hardware. It is available in 9 great finishes. \r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-DSF3225 3 Inch Floor Mount Door Stops, Solid Brass Heavy Duty Floor Mount Door Bumper, Deltana DSF3225 floor door bumpers, 3 inch floor bumpers, big floor door stops,  wood door bumpers, wood door stops, steel door bumpers, steel door stops, doorstops, door dampers, rubber door stops, doorstoppers, door stoppers,  wooden door stops, Deltana 3 inch Floor mounted Door Stops, Deltana door stops, DEL-DSF3225U10B, DEL-DSF3225U15, DEL-DSF3225U15A, DEL-DSF3225U19, DEL-DSF3225U26, DEL-DSF3225U26D, DEL-DSF3225U3, DEL-DSF3225U5, DEL-DSF3225CR003,"
